index 2a087fc..1f46665 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -10,6 +10,13 @@ Supported sites: X/Twitter, Bluesky, Threads, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, Coub,
 2. Lolek downloads the media with gallery-dl or yt-dlp, and converts it with ffmpeg to a format that Telegram accepts.
 3. Lolek sends one rich message (`sendRichMessage`) with up to 50 media files, and caches the Telegram file_ids for the next requests.
 
+Group posts with videos have a **Get video privately** button. Open it and press
+**Start** if Telegram prompts you; Lolek sends the post's videos as separate,
+captionless messages in your private chat, ready to forward. The group keeps the
+rich post. Videos are reused from Telegram without another download or upload.
+Anyone with the link can request the videos. Links survive bot restarts but expire
+when their records are evicted from the download cache.
+
 ## Run
 
 ```bash
